      "statement_id": "P5.CompensationUnderCeiling",
      "statement_sha256": "ff09ca9eb882869dcbff84346866ae7b501114797ce2a5f97865260552ab763b",
      "text": "For cap P D C = P*D/C with C>0 and P>0: (1) if 0<dD<D, the power P*D/(D-dD) restores cap P D C at diversity D-dD and is the only power that does; (2) if moreover P<=Pmax, some P'<=Pmax restores it iff dD <= D*(1-P/Pmax); (3) if D>0, for every M there is delta>0 with P*D/(D-dD) > M whenever D-delta<dD<D; (4) if D>0, every power P' gives cap P' 0 C = 0 < cap P D C.",
      "trivial": false
    },
